  {
   "id": "metal-suits-counter-attack-217505@major-2026-11-03",
   "gameId": "metal-suits-counter-attack-217505",
   "displayName": "Major Update – November 3, 2026",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-11-03T08:31:14.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, this is the Metal Suits development team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A major update for Metal Suits has been released.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update adds a Map Editor that lets you create and play your own maps, along with Korean and English voiced dialogue, and the multiplayer menu has been completely revamped.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We plan to keep updating the game based on player feedback, so please feel free to share your thoughts with us at any time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "※ A minor issue is currently occurring with voiced dialogue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will fix it as quickly as possible and apply the fix in an upcoming update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "■ New Content",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Map Editor (Custom Maps)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now create and play your own maps via \\[Create Map] or \\ in the Custom Maps list.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The editor can be controlled with a gamepad, keyboard, or mouse, and includes \\[?] help and a manual available in 11 languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Supports loading saved maps, renaming, undo/redo, and editing via the object properties panel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Themes and objects are grouped by planet and displayed by name.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Clear conditions can be selected from \\[Reach the Goal] / \\[Defeat the Boss] / \\[Defeat All Enemies].",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A map you create can only be saved after you clear it yourself.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Maps in progress are auto-saved every 3 minutes, and you can resume editing from the list.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Playing custom maps does not affect story progress, achievements, or save data.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Voiced Dialogue (Korean / English)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dialogue is now voiced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can choose \\ / \\ / \\ under \\ in Settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The default voice language follows your OS language.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Korean for Korean OS, English for all other languages",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "BGM volume is automatically lowered by half while voice lines are playing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Scenario Replay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now rewatch past story scenes by chapter from the pause menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Multiplayer Menu Revamp",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The former \\[LAN Battle] menu has been renamed to \\ and divided into \\[Create Steam Room] / \\[Create LAN Room] / \\[Join Room].",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Steam rooms (Steam version only), you can set the visibility to \\ / \\[Friends Only] / \\[Invite Only], and join rooms using a room code.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rooms created by friends appear at the top of the list, and room status is also shown in your friends list.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mobile and PC players can now play together over LAN.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "A notification window will appear if the connection fails or the game versions do not match.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "■ Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Desktop Mouse Support: The mouse cursor is now displayed. Click to advance dialogue, and click and hold to skip.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Save File Protection: If a save file is corrupted, the original is kept as a backup copy, and a \\[New Game] / \\ prompt is shown at startup. Auto-save is suspended until you make a selection.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Display Settings: The default aspect ratio has been changed to Standard (16:9), and fullscreen mode now uses your monitor's native resolution. The Wide/Standard option in Settings remains available as before.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Font Cleanup by Language: Fonts used for each language have been reorganized.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "■ Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where characters appeared mixed or broken in alphabet-based languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where text was cut off in Russian.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue on Android where a single press of the Back button was processed twice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where switching windows during loading left sound effects muted, causing voiced dialogue to be inaudible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue working hard to provide a better gaming experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you encounter any issues while playing or have any suggestions,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "please let us know anytime through our community.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
