  {
   "id": "metal-suits-counter-attack-217505@major-2026-07-08",
   "gameId": "metal-suits-counter-attack-217505",
   "displayName": "Metal Suits Map Editor: Update Notes! #2.",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-08T07:13:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42790663/82e2508cc65955d1caab8d288100874cc89f97f1.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello, this is Link Compass.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's been a while since our last Metal Suits map editor update — and we're excited to share what's new!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Loading & processing, now smoother than ever",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We know the little hiccups you'd sometimes feel while saving or loading in the map editor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In this update, we've reworked the loading and processing pipeline to minimize stuttering and boost overall responsiveness.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Even when working on larger maps, things should now feel a lot more fluid.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Custom fields, made easier to use",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Setting up custom fields has always been one of the more hands-on parts of map making.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've improved the usability here, smoothing out the friction points you ran into while entering and checking values.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once you try it yourself, you'll notice the difference right away.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A brand-new dialogue feature",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now add dialogue and message boxes at just the right moments in your map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This opens up more freedom to bring your own stories and storytelling into your maps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Custom map feature update complete",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The custom map feature within Metal Suits has been successfully updated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After all your patience, you can now build your own maps and enjoy playing through them yourselves.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Step by step, we're working to make your playtime even more enjoyable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Link Compass will keep pushing forward, every single day.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'll keep refining the map editor going forward —",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
