  {
   "id": "metal-suits-counter-attack-217505@1.12",
   "gameId": "metal-suits-counter-attack-217505",
   "displayName": "Update 1.12",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-06T06:52:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "v1.12 Update Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Hell difficulty has been added. Additional suits do not drop in Hell difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. You can now check which stages each item can be obtained from in the Collectibles section of the Elix Notes. [ Settings - Elix Notes - Collectibles ]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.The acquisition method for UPC Medals and Kevin's Parts has been changed. They are now permanently saved upon collection, regardless of whether the stage was cleared or failed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. The Codex has been changed to a global save format. Progress that was previously saved per slot is now shared across all slots.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. A bug that prevented progression on certain PC environments has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. An issue where Steam achievements were not being unlocked has been fixed. Any achievements that were not yet unlocked will be automatically granted upon launching the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "7. The long-awaited Custom Map feature is now available! One test map is included, and the file can be found at [Steam install location]\\steamapps\\common\\Metal Suits\\CustomMaps. A web-based tool for creating your own custom maps is planned for release within 2026. Please refer to the upcoming dev log for more details.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Some difficulty description texts have been revised.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
